-- incentive_scales_2026.csv, and the "2025 GP #s" column of each Model B
-- sheet in Store Handouts 2026.xlsx (last_year_gp, which the CSV omits).
--
-- Store names were matched to store_number by exact Yearly GP against the
-- store_annual_goals seed in migration 20 -- all 36 matched, including the
-- two whose short names are not obvious: "Lex" = Lexington Midas = #3276,
-- "Wesmark" = #3938. Four handout sheets (Rabon, SD Bush, Broad, and the
-- PGW North roll-up) have no store in this portal and are not seeded.
-- =====================================================================
